{"id": "EUVD-2026-102569", "enisaUuid": "0af47420-ac75-3cc0-8ac5-8212c461e673", "description": "Frappe Framework before 15.120.0 and 16.x before 16.33.0 does not enforce the per-user restrict_ip allowlist for non-session authentication methods, including API key, OAuth, and header-based authentication. Attackers holding valid credentials of these types can authenticate from IP addresses outside the allowlist, defeating the configured network-based access restrictions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T01:17:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T16:23:33", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/frappe/security/advisories/GHSA-h9jq-7pgf-hw8q", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-before-16.33.0-restrict-ip-allowlist-bypass-via-api-key-oauth-authentication"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111388", "GHSA-87cm-fpc4-v76f"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0fef4409-d1b7-3c90-bd61-7223c26a4a96", "product": {"name": "frappe", "vendor": {"name": "Elated-Themes"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.120.0"}, {"id": "547873fb-9bb8-3323-bc35-31277c52156e", "product": {"name": "frappe", "vendor": {"name": "Elated-Themes"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0 <16.33.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ffd59bf6-84d3-3852-837a-a72fd300cdde", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}